  "content": "{section: Intro}\n[G]\n\n{section: Verso 1}\n[Em] [C] [G]Clouds roll by\n[G]Reeling is what they say\n[G]Or is it just my way?\n[Em] [C] [G]Wind blows by,\n\n{section: Refrão}\n[D] [Em]Low light\n[C] [G] [D] [Em]Sidetracked, low light\n\n[C] [C/B] [Am7]Can't see my tracks,\n[C/B] [C] [C/B] [D]Your scent-way back\n\n{section: Verso 2}\n[G]Can I be here all alone?\n[G]Clear a path to my home\n[Em] [C] [G]Blood runs dry\n\n[G]Books and jealousy tell me wrong\n[G]All I feel, calm\n[Em] [C] [G]Voice rolls by,\n\n{section: Refrão}\n[D] [Em]Low light\n[C] [G] [D] [Em]Car crash, low light\n\n[C] [C/B] [Am7]Can't wear my mask,\n[C/B] [C] [C/B] [D]Your first, my last\n\n[Em] [C] [G]Voice goes by\n[G]Two birds is what they'll see\n[G]Getting lost upon their way\n[Em] [C] [G]Wind rolls by,\n\n{section: Refrão}\n[D] [Em]Low light\n[C] [G] [D] [Em]Eye sight, low light\n\n[C] (x4)\n\n[D] [Em]I need the light\n\n[C] [C/B] [Am7] [C/B] [C] [C/B] [Am7]I'll find my way from wrong, what's real?\n[C/B] [C] [C/B] [D]Your dream I see\n\n{section: Outro}\n[D]"
